info.description:
JWT-protected backend endpoints for CharteredInfo E-Way Bill flow.

Flow:
1. Save EWB Settings (one-time setup)
2. Get Access Token  →  token auto-saved to {{eway_auth_token}}
3. Generate EWB (single-click)  →  ewb_no auto-saved to {{ewaybill_no}}
4. Check status / Update vehicle / Cancel / Print / View
